{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-sdk-agent","title":"AI SDK 6 工具循环代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/agent-loop/ai-sdk-agent","wordCount":1248,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-sdk-6-工具循环代理\">AI SDK 6 工具循环代理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>上一节手写的 ReAct 循环，在 AI SDK 6 里被压缩成声明式 API：<code>generateText</code> + <code>tools</code> + <code>stopWhen</code> 就是完整的 ReAct 循环。框架接手了「调模型 → 执行工具 → 回填结果 → 继续推理」的全部机械工作，你只需声明工具与终止条件。</p>\n<p>迁移不是「重写」，而是「删除自己写的那部分」——把手动循环里由你维护的职责，逐项交给框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>手动 ReActAgent</th>\n<th>AI SDK generateText</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调用模型</td>\n<td><code>think()</code> 手动调用</td>\n<td>内部自动调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行工具</td>\n<td><code>act()</code> 遍历执行</td>\n<td>自动调用 <code>tool.execute</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回填结果</td>\n<td><code>observe()</code> 构造 <code>ModelMessage</code></td>\n<td>自动管理消息列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环控制</td>\n<td><code>while</code> + <code>stepCount</code></td>\n<td><code>stopWhen</code> 终止条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止判断</td>\n<td><code>toolCalls.length === 0</code></td>\n<td>自动检测 <code>finishReason</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制终止</td>\n<td><code>forceFinish()</code> 发额外提示</td>\n<td>达到步数上限直接停止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>但框架抽象并非无脑替代品，最关键的差异在<strong>错误处理</strong>：SDK 默认「工具抛异常即终止整轮生成」，而手动循环通常希望把错误当作 Observation 喂回模型让它改道。因此迁移时错误处理必须下沉到 <code>tool.execute</code> 内部自行捕获，否则一次可恢复的失败就会作废前几步的成果。</p>\n<p>框架能覆盖绝大多数场景，但有五类需求它表达不了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义终止逻辑——需要根据工具结果的内容决定是否继续。</li>\n<li>步骤间外部状态管理——维护数据库事务、文件锁等跨步骤状态。</li>\n<li>条件分支循环——根据中间结果切换工具集或模型。</li>\n<li>人机协作循环——某些步骤需暂停等待用户确认。</li>\n<li>异构模型编排——不同步骤使用不同模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判断「该用框架还是手写」，就是对照这份清单。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"从手动循环到框架抽象\">从手动循环到框架抽象</h2><p>上一节从零构建了完整的 ReAct 循环。AI SDK 6 将这些步骤封装为声明式 API：<code>generateText</code> 配合 <code>tools</code> + <code>stopWhen</code> 就是完整的 ReAct 循环。本节将手动实现迁移到 AI SDK 的内置机制，并深入理解框架在背后做了什么。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph manual[&quot;手动实现&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        M1[&quot;think()&quot;] --&gt; M2[&quot;act()&quot;]&#10;        M2 --&gt; M3[&quot;observe()&quot;]&#10;        M3 --&gt; M4[&quot;while 循环&quot;]&#10;        M4 --&gt; M1&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph sdk[&quot;AI SDK 6&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        S1[&quot;generateText()&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;tools + stopWhen&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;自动循环&quot;]&#10;        S1 --&gt; S2 --&gt; S3&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    manual --&gt;|&quot;迁移&quot;| sdk\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph manual[\"手动实现\"]\n        direction TB\n        M1[\"think()\"] --&gt; M2[\"act()\"]\n        M2 --&gt; M3[\"observe()\"]\n        M3 --&gt; M4[\"while 循环\"]\n        M4 --&gt; M1\n    end\n\n    subgraph sdk[\"AI SDK 6\"]\n        direction TB\n        S1[\"generateText()\"]\n        S2[\"tools + stopWhen\"]\n        S3[\"自动循环\"]\n        S1 --&gt; S2 --&gt; S3\n    end\n\n    manual --&gt;|\"迁移\"| sdk</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"generatetext-stopwhen-内置-react-循环\">generateText + stopWhen：内置 ReAct 循环</h2><p>AI SDK 的 <code>generateText</code> 在设置 <code>stopWhen: stepCountIs(n)</code> 后自动执行 ReAct 循环——执行工具、回填结果、继续推理，直到模型返回纯文本或达到步数上限：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { generateText, tool, stepCountIs } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;&#10;const result = await generateText({&#10;  model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;  system: &#39;你是一个有用的助手，可以查询天气和进行数学计算。&#39;,&#10;  prompt: &#39;北京和东京的温差是多少度？&#39;,&#10;  tools: {&#10;    weather: tool({&#10;      description: &#39;获取指定城市的当前天气&#39;,&#10;      inputSchema: z.object({ city: z.string().describe(&#39;城市名称&#39;) }),&#10;      execute: async ({ city }) =&gt; {&#10;        const db: Record&lt;string, number&gt; = { 北京: 28, 东京: 32 };&#10;        return { city, temp: db[city] ?? 20 };&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;    calculator: tool({&#10;      description: &#39;执行数学计算&#39;,&#10;      inputSchema: z.object({ expression: z.string() }),&#10;      execute: async ({ expression }) =&gt; ({&#10;        expression,&#10;        result: new Function(`return ${expression}`)(),&#10;      }),&#10;    }),&#10;  },&#10;  stopWhen: stepCountIs(10),&#10;});&#10;&#10;console.log(result.text);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { generateText, tool, stepCountIs } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  system: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'你是一个有用的助手，可以查询天气和进行数学计算。'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'北京和东京的温差是多少度？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tools: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weather: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'获取指定城市的当前天气'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      inputSchema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ city: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'城市名称'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">city</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { 北京: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, 东京: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { city, temp: db[city] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    calculator: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'执行数学计算'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      inputSchema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ expression: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        expression,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`return ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">expression</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stopWhen: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stepCountIs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.text);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比上一节 ~100 行的 <code>ReActAgent</code> 类，SDK 版本用 ~30 行完成了相同功能。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"手动实现-vs-ai-sdk-对照\">手动实现 vs AI SDK 对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>手动 ReActAgent</th>\n<th>AI SDK generateText</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调用模型</td>\n<td><code>think()</code> 手动调用</td>\n<td>内部自动调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行工具</td>\n<td><code>act()</code> 遍历执行</td>\n<td>自动调用 <code>tool.execute</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回填结果</td>\n<td><code>observe()</code> 构造 <code>ModelMessage</code></td>\n<td>自动管理消息列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环控制</td>\n<td><code>while</code> + <code>stepCount</code></td>\n<td><code>stopWhen</code> 终止条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止判断</td>\n<td><code>toolCalls.length === 0</code></td>\n<td>自动检测 <code>finishReason</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>try-catch 包裹工具调用</td>\n<td>工具抛异常则终止生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制终止</td>\n<td><code>forceFinish()</code> 发额外提示</td>\n<td>达到步数上限直接停止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键差异在错误处理。SDK 默认工具抛异常则整个 <code>generateText</code> 抛出。要实现优雅降级，需在 <code>execute</code> 内部捕获：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const robustTool = tool({&#10;  description: &#39;带错误恢复的工具&#39;,&#10;  inputSchema: z.object({ query: z.string() }),&#10;  execute: async ({ query }) =&gt; {&#10;    try {&#10;      return await riskyOperation(query);&#10;    } catch (err) {&#10;      return { error: err instanceof Error ? err.message : &#39;执行失败&#39; };&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> robustTool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'带错误恢复的工具'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inputSchema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ query: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> riskyOperation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { error: err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">instanceof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err.message </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '执行失败'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"steps-追踪与-onstepfinish-监听\">steps 追踪与 onStepFinish 监听</h2><p><code>result.steps</code> 提供每一步的详细信息，<code>onStepFinish</code> 回调实现实时监听：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const result = await generateText({&#10;  model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;  prompt: &#39;分析北京和东京的天气差异&#39;,&#10;  tools: {&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  },&#10;  stopWhen: stepCountIs(10),&#10;  onStepFinish: ({ stepType, toolCalls, usage }) =&gt; {&#10;    if (stepType === &#39;tool-result&#39;) {&#10;      for (const call of toolCalls) {&#10;        console.log(`[Agent] 调用工具: ${call.toolName}`);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    console.log(`[Agent] 本步消耗 ${usage.totalTokens} tokens`);&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;for (const [i, step] of result.steps.entries()) {&#10;  console.log(`Step ${i + 1}: ${step.finishReason}`);&#10;  for (const call of step.toolCalls) {&#10;    console.log(`  Action: ${call.toolName}(${JSON.stringify(call.args)})`);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'分析北京和东京的天气差异'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#